{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0542_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0542_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b6cde12063e860b70ca7afea1c260957dabea1902eb14434817a1a3218f6c81e", "ja": "（のり子が『バイクに乗った悪魔』役を演じることに\nなった。本番に向け、レッスン中なのだが……）", "zh": "（诺莉子要出演“骑着摩托车的恶魔”这个角色。为了正式演出，她正在上课练习，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0542_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0542_1001_043nor", "source_sha256": "f8ec095ec724aa541a304cc074e312a98e120c29bfc2d432476faf1f5c3eecd6", "ja": "「アンタ達、ついてきな！　好きなだけ暴れさせて\nやるよ！」……う～ん、やっぱりなんか微妙だなぁ。", "zh": "“你们，跟上来！让你们尽情大闹个够！”……嗯～总觉得还是有点不对劲啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0542_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0542_1002_p", "source_sha256": "ae30f1a9e5521d853d0567159d67ef583dc084c7aaac1bd9f3cc0c3c794fb712", "ja": "そうか？\nいい演技に見えたけど……どこが気になるんだ？", "zh": "是吗？\n我觉得演得挺好的……你到底在意哪里？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0542_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0542_1003_043nor", "source_sha256": "56ebcede6f1c7278c1dc570a1ab9720abf8a128bed328eff822d293dba524771", "ja": "アタシも上手く言えないんだけど、こう……\n悪魔の役に入り切れてないな、って思うんだよね。", "zh": "我也说不好，就是觉得……还没完全进入恶魔这个角色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0542_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0542_1004_043nor", "source_sha256": "d5cac090760009de09910eee1178e2495d796d1164ec3757678065f6256812ff", "ja": "イメトレだと完璧にできたのに。\n実際にやってみると、しっくりこなくて……。", "zh": "明明在想象训练里能做到完美的。实际试着做了之后，却总觉得不太对劲……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0542_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0542_1005_p", "source_sha256": "c66b9cd01588ddd2c377dea0b28ea97484ddc1764f20410be4a8a1f5e11a5d38", "ja": "なるほど。まあ、本番では衣装もセットもあるから\nあまり心配しなくても……。", "zh": "原来如此。不过正式演出时有服装和布景，所以不用太担心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0542_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0542_1006_043nor", "source_sha256": "8ec4d5a8145175fcefcf3990fc04e4acfa8bf1686a038650111f118e51cf02d7", "ja": "あ、待って！　いい方法、思いついたかも！\nふふふっ……練習にピッタリの、ア・レ！", "zh": "啊，等等！我好像想到一个好办法！\n呵呵呵……非常适合练习的，那·个！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0542_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0542_1007_p", "source_sha256": "990bf815303fa0e46adcea564ec0d8038915100206f16831264e4c8cef64627e", "ja": "えっ？　アレって？", "zh": "诶？你说的那个是？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0542_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0542_1008_043nor", "source_sha256": "e89bd7ecf638bcb7da454c2296d173133c51487350d585110f93ab82652cd6c7", "ja": "もう、クラウザー号があるじゃん！　『バイクに乗った\n悪魔』だし、跨るだけでも全然違う気がするんだよね。", "zh": "真是的，不是还有克劳瑟号嘛！而且还是“骑摩托车的\n恶魔”，感觉哪怕只是跨坐上去，效果都完全不一样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0542_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0542_1009_043nor", "source_sha256": "db709b31f2eeb7b9fe66315adc5cb35b57c8d7deead5fc9f565c7f36c1191648", "ja": "よ～し、クラウザー号と一緒に練習だー！\nバイクがアタシを呼んでるぜ……なんてね♪", "zh": "好～，和克劳泽号一起练习吧——！\n摩托车正在呼唤我……开玩笑的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
